cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Jotter Notarum: Feedback Generator"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based comment-bank tool for marking. Load your own bank of frequently
  used feedback comments, tick the ones that apply to a student's work, and
  generate feedback to edit and copy into your marking system. Everything runs in
  the browser and nothing is uploaded.
authors:
